KARLTON: Is there a
problem with the transfer?

878
01:07:53.090 --> 01:07:54.659
Hello.

879
01:07:54.660 --> 01:07:57.613
KARLTON: Do you know whose
phone you have, young lady?

880
01:08:00.920 --> 01:08:02.295
